</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c4403ad8-8088-11f1-9ec4-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26182378391392.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c4403ad8-8088-11f1-9ec4-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26182378391392.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">2bd87160-8089-11f1-9a1d-75fe1101079b</guid><pubDate>Wed, 15 Jul 2026 20:10:05 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c4403ad8-8088-11f1-9ec4-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26182378391392.jpg">AP Photo/Efrem Lukatsky - Efrem Lukatsky</source><dc:creator>左依</dc:creator></item><item><category>国际</category><title>阿根廷2比1逆转英格兰，周六即将迎来"英法战争"</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85/20260715-%E9%98%BF%E6%A0%B9%E5%BB%B72%E6%AF%941%E9%80%86%E8%BD%AC%E8%8B%B1%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%B0%EF%BC%8C%E5%91%A8%E5%85%AD%E5%8D%B3%E5%B0%86%E8%BF%8E%E6%9D%A5-%E8%8B%B1%E6%B3%95%E6%88%98%E4%BA%89</link><description>
